test-results/
*.log
# Keep the session safety net (hooks + checkpoint wiring) in the repo, so a
# fresh clone is protected too. Everything else Claude writes here is local.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/launch.json
.superpowers/

# The local STORAGE_DIR. Unset, `storageRoot` falls back to ./storage relative
# to whichever process is running, so a dev worker drops client attachments,
# post images and rendered documents inside the repo. In production this is a
# mounted volume; here it is scratch, and none of it belongs in git.
#
# Anchored to where a process actually writes. A bare `storage/` matched at any
# depth, which also swallowed source directories such as
# packages/channels/src/storage/ — a new file there was silently invisible to
# git status and would never have been committed.
/storage/
/apps/*/storage/
/packages/*/storage/
